# {{title}}

A Jellyfesh source plugin, made with `jf-plugin new`.

```sh
jf-plugin build              # target/plugins/{{name}}.wasm
jf-plugin pack --release     # target/plugins/{{id}}-0.1.0.jfpkg
jf-plugin sign target/plugins/{{id}}-0.1.0.jfpkg --key ~/keys/jellyfesh-signing.key
jf-plugin inspect target/plugins/{{id}}-0.1.0.jfpkg
```

Edit `manifest.toml` (id, name, author, capabilities, network allowlist),
`settings.schema.json` and `src/lib.rs`. The plugin authoring guide in the
Jellyfesh repository (`docs/plugins/authoring.md`) explains the rest.
